{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11301660","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11301660","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130166001:1":{"text":"저희는 이곳에 특별한 신의 유적지를 연구하러 왔어요...","source_cn":"我们之所以会来带这里，是研究此地特殊的神代遗迹的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB09E24801C4A487D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130166002:1":{"text":"그런데 선배가 트라이브 문명에 푹 빠져서 연구 방향을 바꾸려고 하잖아요!","source_cn":"但没想到，前辈被蛮血的文明迷住了，说要改变研究方向！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3939C9EB613369D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130166003:1":{"text":"이건 정말 큰 일이에요. 흑흑, 교수님께는 어떻게 말씀드려야 할지...","source_cn":"这可是件大事，呜呜，我要怎么告诉导师啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43AFA491FB3A8B8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者米尼亚":{"text":"상록수 학회 학자 미니아","source":"冬青学者米尼亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}